  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento de la Gobernanza Forestal</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of Forest Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Consolidar la estrategia integral de control a la deforestacin y gestin sostenible de los bosques, especficamente en sus lneas de: (i) fomento a una economa forestal basada en los bienes y servicios de los bosques para el desarrollo integral en el cierre de la frontera agropecuaria; (ii) monitoreo de los bosques, control permanente y la implementacin en territorio de los lineamientos del programa de forestera comunitaria; y (iii) desarrollar e implementar el Sistema de Trazabilidad Forestal en Colombia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidate the integral control strategy for deforestation and sustainable management of forests, specifically in its lines of: (i) promotion of a forestry economy based on forest goods and services for integral development in the closure of the agricultural frontier ; (ii) monitoring of the forests, permanent control and implementation in the territory of the community forestry program guidelines; and (iii) develop and implement the Forest Traceability System in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
